1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:02,747
Six arms... is it a bug?

2
00:00:03,197 --> 00:00:12,641
BZZT! Not a bug! Six arms are not six legs. And my pages are... frozen!

3
00:00:12,691 --> 00:00:16,565
Frozen? Oh no! Each page keeps a secret sense.

4
00:00:16,615 --> 00:00:19,721
Remember the secret... and the page melts!

5
00:00:19,721 --> 00:00:24,556
Hurry... I'm getting so sleepy... Let's wake up your pages!

6
00:00:24,606 --> 00:00:30,050
Big secrets of tiny bugs! Page one... taste! I'll warm it up!

7
00:00:32,000 --> 00:00:34,015
Which one will Flutter pick?

8
00:00:37,765 --> 00:00:39,764
That one's not sweet at all!

9
00:00:41,064 --> 00:00:42,864
Not yummy!

10
00:00:44,730 --> 00:00:48,380
Flutter picked the sweet one! But how did Flutter know?

11
00:00:48,430 --> 00:00:52,573
With its tongue... or its feet? Three... two... one!

12
00:00:53,223 --> 00:00:56,773
Its feet! Butterflies taste with their feet!

13
00:00:59,823 --> 00:01:07,102
Secret unlocked! One page warm... three to go! Ooh, this page smells funny!

14
00:01:07,502 --> 00:01:12,552
Page two... smell! A maze! The trail only shows in my lens.

15
00:01:13,352 --> 00:01:15,710
I'll sniff the way with my antennae!

16
00:01:16,810 --> 00:01:18,610
Left or right?

17
00:01:19,507 --> 00:01:21,307
Left!

18
00:01:22,155 --> 00:01:23,955
Up or down?

19
00:01:25,451 --> 00:01:28,315
Nope! Oh no! I forgot to sniff!

20
00:01:30,665 --> 00:01:32,465
Left or right?

21
00:01:33,162 --> 00:01:34,962
Right!

22
00:01:36,929 --> 00:01:42,209
Tap, tap, hello! Ants sniff with their antennae... ...and follow smell trails!

23
00:01:44,109 --> 00:01:50,211
Secret unlocked! Two pages warm! Listen! I hear music!

24
00:01:50,611 --> 00:01:52,724
Page three... hearing!

25
00:01:55,724 --> 00:02:01,068
Let's find their ears! Ears go on heads... right? Nope! Not there!

26
00:02:02,168 --> 00:02:04,665
Chirp's ears are on its front legs!

27
00:02:05,165 --> 00:02:08,457
And Hop? On its head? Nope! Not there!

28
00:02:09,557 --> 00:02:11,773
Hop's ears are on its tummy!

29
00:02:13,573 --> 00:02:15,906
Ears on legs... ears on tummies!

30
00:02:17,806 --> 00:02:22,357
Secret unlocked! Three pages warm!

31
00:02:22,857 --> 00:02:25,469
Page four... sight and signals!

32
00:02:26,269 --> 00:02:28,473
I'll sneak up on the dragonfly!

33
00:02:32,173 --> 00:02:36,807
How did Zip see me? Its giant eyes cover most of its head!

34
00:02:37,607 --> 00:02:42,777
Blink, do you know a secret? I'm not glowing! Your tail says you do!

35
00:02:45,377 --> 00:02:48,627
Some fireflies flash their own secret code!

36
00:02:49,427 --> 00:02:51,792
And Waggle's dance shows the way...

37
00:02:54,792 --> 00:02:59,385
Secret unlocked! Four pages warm!

38
00:03:00,585 --> 00:03:06,976
This page is empty! Where do bugs go in winter? No memory... no secret...

39
00:03:07,276 --> 00:03:11,586
Then I'll find a new one... outside! I'll keep Albie warm!

40
00:03:11,636 --> 00:03:13,898
My family's snug under the ground!

41
00:03:16,198 --> 00:03:18,330
Brr! So cold!

42
00:03:18,730 --> 00:03:20,530
Is anyone home?

43
00:03:20,556 --> 00:03:23,031
Honeybees huddle in a warm ball!

44
00:03:24,831 --> 00:03:27,910
Some ladybugs nap together under leaves!

45
00:03:27,910 --> 00:03:30,091
One, two, three... so many!

46
00:03:31,991 --> 00:03:37,333
A woolly bear caterpillar! It freezes all winter... ...and wakes up in spring!

47
00:03:38,933 --> 00:03:40,892
Oh no! I can't see!

48
00:03:41,792 --> 00:03:43,965
Heat lens... on!

49
00:03:43,965 --> 00:03:46,263
The warm window! That way!

50
00:03:49,863 --> 00:03:51,848
Three winter secrets!

51
00:03:53,548 --> 00:03:59,950
Secret unlocked! All my pages are warm! Do you remember?

52
00:04:00,000 --> 00:04:02,168
Where does a butterfly taste?

53
00:04:04,168 --> 00:04:07,736
With its feet, of course! What do ants sniff with?

54
00:04:09,736 --> 00:04:13,256
With their antennae! Where does a grasshopper hear?

55
00:04:15,256 --> 00:04:18,826
On its tummy! And where did the ladybugs sleep?

56
00:04:20,826 --> 00:04:22,760
Together, under leaves!

57
00:04:23,560 --> 00:04:29,241
Time for a winter nap? See you in spring! Look closely... even in winter.

58
00:04:29,291 --> 00:04:31,724
Ah... ah... CHOO!

59
00:04:34,324 --> 00:04:36,124
Now THAT'S a bug!

60
00:04:37,123 --> 00:04:38,960
Did you spot Rollo?

61
00:04:44,560 --> 00:04:46,606
Can you find him next time?
